# Design mockups and their notes — EXCLUDED DELIBERATELY, do not un-ignore.
# mockups/README.md records the verified case study's real property name and its
# Expedia property ID. This repo is PUBLIC, and the numeric ID de-anonymises the
# property as completely as the name does (it resolves directly to the listing).
# Naming the property requires written consent from the property.
# The served component (src/components/VerifiedCase.astro) is already clean —
# it carries the numbers without the identity. Keep it that way.
mockups/

# Internal build/planning notes — excluded for the same reason as mockups/.
# reports/2026-08-15-phase2-implementation-plan.md names the property's location
# and records, in its own decision log, that consent to name either property was
# "Withheld on both". Publishing it to a public repo would contradict that.
reports/
